      "seed": 751452623,
      "version": 704,
      "versionNonce": 191969377,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750521295587,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Description:\nMain REB class representing \nREB device with its built in \nparameters.\n\nAttributes:\n- Name\n- Init object\n- Init object classname\n- Max Range\n- Max Deadzone\n- Max Strenght\n- Ratio (Range/Deadzone)\n- Is on\n- Can modify Range\n- Can modify Strenght\n- List of OBJECT_REB\n\nMethods:\n- Constructor (init all params)\n- Destructor (just delete)\n- Set Active (set Is on param)\n- Add OBJECT_REB\n- Remove OBJECT_REB",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Description:\nMain REB class representing \nREB device with its built in \nparameters.\n\nAttributes:\n- Name\n- Init object\n- Init object classname\n- Max Range\n- Max Deadzone\n- Max Strenght\n- Ratio (Range/Deadzone)\n- Is on\n- Can modify Range\n- Can modify Strenght\n- List of OBJECT_REB\n\nMethods:\n- Constructor (init all params)\n- Destructor (just delete)\n- Set Active (set Is on param)\n- Add OBJECT_REB\n- Remove OBJECT_REB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
